# LF in the working tree on every platform, not just in the repository.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, and SYSTEM_PROMPT.md and the
# agent-skills SKILL.md files are include_str!'d into the binary at build time.
# A CRLF checkout therefore ships a binary whose own `\n`-boundary parsing
# fails: playbook_md() stops stripping the template's leading HTML comment and
# prepends it to every agent's system prompt.
#
# Binary files are detected and left alone by `text=auto`.
* text=auto eol=lf
